For the latest news, visit the SparForte web site.

Objective: Foundation for value meta labels (Phase 2)

Known Issues

SparForte will run slower because of the value meta labels checking at run-time.

CHANGES SINCE 3.0

1. Fix: In files.is_execute/is_execute file, the group execute permission is now checked.

2. Fix: In files.is_readable and other functions that check readability, in edge cases where the kernel getlogin() fails and, in turn, group_member() fails, the read access checks fall back to checking the simple file gid againt the user's effective gid.  Comments also fixed in c_os.c.

3. Change: when a hash-able command (e.g. "foo") is not found but a file exists without executable permission, an error message describes this condition rather than describing it as not found. When a command path (e.g. "/bin/foo") cannot be run when the file exists without executable permission, an error describes this condition rather than describing it as not found.

4. pragma annotate( assisted ) for automation generated source code as per Linux kernel standards. [docs needed]

5. Fix: certain edge cases in subprogram parameter names like names already in use, duplicate parameter names, a parameter with the name of the subprogram should now work correctly.

6. Fix: most declarations now include the declaration location for error messages (such as enum type items, for example).

7. Fix: better error message for missing filenames on a shell redirect (e.g. echo >;). [Needs Fixing]

8. New: constant values are checked for placeholder values in testing and maintenance modes.

9. Fix: -C / --coding disables the default testing mode flag instead of enabling both.

10. Fix: case statments can now test array elements as well as scalar variables.

11. Fix: using an parent meta tag to declare a child tag no longer has an unreferenced error.

12. Change: general cleanup of provision script.  Support for os-release file when detecting your O/S.

13. Fix: no bug report is displayed if a forked process fails (e.g. bad bang path).

14. Fix: Sturges formula, reverse of ln2/ln10 constants fixed in parser_numerics.  Fixed documentation for shannon_entropy_of and modulus.

15. Change: added GNU readline version 9 detection to configure script.

16. Change: strings.is_fixed allows a leading space or minus sign.

